# Title: HackTool - Inveigh Execution
# ID: b99a1518-1ad5-4f65-bc95-1ffff97a8fd0
# Status: test
# Level: critical
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-10-24
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003.001
# Description: Detects the use of Inveigh a cross-platform .NET IPv4/IPv6 machine-in-the-middle tool
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_path="*\\Inveigh.exe") OR ((process_name="\\Inveigh.exe" OR process_name="\\Inveigh.dll")) OR (Description="Inveigh") OR ((process_exec="* -SpooferIP*" OR process_exec="* -ReplyToIPs *" OR process_exec="* -ReplyToDomains *" OR process_exec="* -ReplyToMACs *" OR process_exec="* -SnifferIP*")))
